cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these codes, please cite them as below."
title: "New linear codes over GF(4): thirteen codes above the lower bounds of codetables.de"
authors:
  - family-names: "Bolívar Centeno"
    given-names: "Ignacio"
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23989999"
date-released: "2026-11-05"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/IgnacioBolivarCenteno/linear-code-records"
abstract: >-
  Thirteen linear codes over GF(4) whose minimum distance is one or two above the lower bounds
  in the tables at codetables.de (as read on 2026-11-05), raising 29 cells of the table. Each
  code is given by its generator matrix in Magma format, with its construction from a
  1-generator quasi-cyclic code, in ten cases through Construction X.
keywords:
  - linear codes
  - quasi-cyclic codes
  - Construction X
  - minimum distance
  - GF(4)
